                        "entry_id": "50dd534c-add1-324f-9446-bff3360dee7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "единица измерения электрического сопротивления и электрического импеданса в системе СИ"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "63af10ec-8fd1-4b22-8950-f0b7fc696e6c",
                                "sense_id": "382578de-f65a-3ef9-8355-48559d2a7175",
                                "text": "Сопротивление этого резистора составляет сто ом."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb260869-fdfc-41b9-afff-5435e2338ccb",
                        "source_entry_id": "50dd534c-add1-324f-9446-bff3360dee7c",
                        "source_sense_id": "382578de-f65a-3ef9-8355-48559d2a7175",
                        "target_lang_word": "ohm",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ohm",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "635562b3-9e98-3808-b2f3-0299d27b376d",
                                        "entry_id": "d2aed13f-b6ea-3461-ae90-4da7d8875094",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In the International System of Units, the derived unit of electrical resistance; the electrical resistance of a device across which a potential difference of one volt causes a current of one ampere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb4fe4bd-9f93-4b33-9624-c2fc9bbb33b3",
                                                "sense_id": "635562b3-9e98-3808-b2f3-0299d27b376d",
                                                "text": "If the volt, ampere and ohm were taken as the absolute units, the practical units would be the ampere, begohm and begavolt, names just as convenient as ampere, coulomb and farad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b484376f-4d6b-4f0f-a9eb-89bcc74f9579",
                                                "sense_id": "635562b3-9e98-3808-b2f3-0299d27b376d",
                                                "text": "As the test light voltage touches terminal \"C7\", the module should switch, causing the ohmmeter to \"overrange\" if the meter is in the 1000-2000 ohms position."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
